# The RINEX day and the Overpass response stay out (hundreds of MB). The
# SIGNED PRE-MAP does not: it is 114 kB, it is deterministic for a fixed
# station and radius, and the deploy cannot build without it. Fetching it in
# CI made the Pages publish depend on a free public Overpass endpoint, which
# failed the deploy twice running -- HTTP 504, then [Errno 101] Network is
# unreachable. Committed, the workflow's `[ -s data/terrain_usn8.npz ]` guard
# short-circuits and no build touches the network.
#
# The PRIVATE signing key is NOT here and must never be: nothing in the build
# re-signs. Verification needs the map, its detached signature and the public
# key, all three of which are public by construction.
data/*
!data/terrain_usn8.npz
!data/terrain_usn8.npz.sig
!data/terrain_map_pub.pem
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
out/
*.mp4
.cache/

# Track F environment assets: fetched by bootstrap.sh (console/web/env/ASSETS.txt), never committed
console/web/vendor/asset-env-*

# Built static site (deploy/build_static.py); rebuilt from out/ + vendor assets
site/

# wrangler local state
.wrangler/
out/beats/
